OL,3,GNEWSACouple, 89, 'lucky to be alive'
OL,4,Aafter caravan arson
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn elderly couple are "lucky to be
OL,7,Falive" after a caravan next door was
OL,8,Fdeliberately set alight, their nephew
OL,9,Fsays.
OL,11,FAnn and Peter Wollam, both 89, were
OL,12,Fleft "shook up" after they were forced
OL,13,Fto flee their house on Bentley Road
OL,14,FSouth in Darlaston when their nephew,
OL,15,FGreg Yates, saw smoke and 20ft flames
OL,16,Fcoming from the vehicle.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
