OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACouple, 89, 'lucky to be alive'
OL,4,Aafter caravan arson
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Midlands Police confirmed the
OL,7,Fcaravan was deliberately set on fire on
OL,8,F21 August. The blaze spread to the
OL,9,Fderelict building, causing extensive
OL,10,Fdamage. The front of the Wollam's home
OL,11,Fwas also affected.
OL,13,F"We had to get them out the back. By
OL,14,Fthen flames were licking up the
OL,15,Fhouses," said Yates, who added the
OL,16,Fblaze followed ignored warnings of
OL,17,Fvandalism to Walsall Council.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
